  "description": "With Virtue of Strength out, alice's Forest makes {G}{G}{G}, paying for Garenbrig Growth with two left over; her nonbasic Hushwood Verge and bob's Forest each still make one {G}",
  "note": "Alice casts the Adventure half of a second Virtue, tapping only her Forest, and returns Grizzly Bears (a creature card in her graveyard, not bob's Hill Giant or her Giant Growth) to hand, the card going to exile (CR 716.3d); two {G} float. Her Hushwood Verge, a nonbasic land, adds one {G}, not three; bob's basic Forest, tapped by bob, adds one {G}: only basic lands alice taps are tripled."
